==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Battle UFO (Enemy)|Battle UFO]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

